  characterName: "Frida Hern\xE1ndez"
  promptText: Developers offer me steady wages to stay silent as resorts replace
    my ancestral beachfront sanctuary. Accepting secures immediate family income;
    refusing defends my land and heritage for future generations.
  leftAnswer: A steady job can provide immediate security for your family.
  rightAnswer: Refusing preserves legacy and land for those who come next.
